/**
 * device-ai Host SDK selftest (round 50, P1-3 host step 2).
 *
 * Repo copy (decoder-spec 4.3-2 item 4: TS coverage into CI; the .artifacts
 * original stays as round-50 evidence). Run (packages/api-client):
 *   npm test
 * i.e. node --experimental-transform-types \
 *   --import ./tests/device-ai/json-esm-hook.mjs \
 *   ./tests/device-ai/device-ai-host-selftest.mts
 *
 * Sections:
 *   A. Server DTO field-name parity (frozen lists manually transcribed from
 *      apps/api/tire_api/device_ai.py + ai_analysis.py AnalysisRequest).
 *   B. question trim-once + bare sha256 parity against Python reference
 *      digests (host-expected-fingerprints.json, generated by
 *      gen-expected-fingerprints.py over the sealed
 *      tire_api.device_ai_projection reference).
 *   C. selection_sha256 / device_context_fingerprint / local_preview_fingerprint
 *      parity with the same Python reference vectors (fingerprint-spec 2/3/4).
 *   D. device-ai-exact regression anchors from e1-canonical-vectors-a.json.
 *   E. computeLocalPreview over the SEALED projection vectors (P1-4b): four
 *      domains + frozen_decision_closure, projection_binding="recomputed"
 *      with projection_sha256 anchored to the sealed canonical shas, plus
 *      fail-closed cases (binding drift, member/receipt mismatch, consent
 *      gate, mode/kind mismatch).
 *   F. DeviceAiJournal: append/readAll/verify + tamper + chain break + the
 *      five fences (owner / generation / SHA / clock / session).
 *   G. DeviceAiHostClient over a mock transport: paths, Idempotency-Key,
 *      closed request bodies, error passthrough, response checks.
 *   H. resolveUnknownOutcome (N18): lookup-first, never resubmit.
 */
